# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

divtrap is project
divtrap purpose "Divide by a number that reaches zero, so the program traps; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
divtrap target console
divtrap version "0.1.0"
divtrap language refined 1
divtrap standardLibrary 1
divtrap allows write console.stdout none
divtrap requires none
divtrap includesModule divtrap
divtrap entry divtrap.main
